units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/cubic
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
mass 1 58.6934
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 10
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 100 iso 1 1 1000
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
run 220000
